[{"id": 1, "title": "流程圖符號與繪製", "chapter": "封面", "bg": "navy", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:24px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:66px;margin-bottom:14px;'>🔀</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>流程圖符號與繪製</h1>\n  <h2 style='font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:400;color:#93c5fd;margin-bottom:24px;'>Flowchart · Drawing Your Algorithm</h2>\n  <div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px;'><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>⬭ 開始結束</span><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>▭ 處理</span><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>◇ 決策</span><span style='background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#e0f2fe;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;'>🍳 蛋炒飯流程圖</span></div>\n  <p style='color:#bfdbfe;font-size:1.05rem;'>七年級第二學期 ｜ 第 8–9 週</p>\n</div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 2, "title": "文字 vs 圖", "chapter": "第一節：為什麼要畫流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🖼️ 為什麼要把演算法「畫」出來？</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#fef2f2;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>📝</div><strong style='color:#991b1b;font-size:.9rem;'>用文字寫</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>「先把油倒進鍋中，然後看油熱了沒有，如果還沒熱就繼續加熱，熱了的話就開中火加入蛋，接著看蛋凝固了沒有，沒有就快速攪拌……」<br><br>😵 很長、很難看出「判斷」和「重複」在哪裡。</div></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🔀</div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.9rem;'>用流程圖畫</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>🔹 一眼看出步驟順序<br>🔹 「判斷」用菱形，分岔很清楚<br>🔹 「重複」用箭頭繞回去<br>🔹 寫程式前先畫好，比較不會出錯</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;border-left:4px solid #0d9488;'><p style='margin:0;color:#0f172a;font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.7;'>📖 <strong>流程圖（Flowchart）</strong>：用標準的圖形符號和箭頭，把演算法的步驟和流程畫出來。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 3, "title": "生活中的流程圖", "chapter": "第一節：為什麼要畫流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🏥 生活中的流程圖</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🏥</div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;'>醫院看診流程</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>掛號 → 候診 → 看診 → 批價 → 領藥。醫院牆上常貼著這種流程指示。</div></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🚨</div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.9rem;'>防災疏散圖</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>地震發生 → 是否在室內？→ 趴下、掩護、穩住 → 震後依路線疏散</div></div><div style='background:#fefce8;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🔌</div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.9rem;'>電器故障排除</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>說明書常見：「無法開機？→ 插頭有插好嗎？→ 是 → 檢查保險絲」</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 💬 找找看：學校或捷運站有沒有貼著用箭頭表示步驟的海報？那就是生活中的流程圖。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 4, "title": "流程的三種基本走法", "chapter": "第一節：為什麼要畫流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🛤️ 流程的三種基本走法（預告）</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>⬇️</div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;'>循序：一路往下</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>步驟一個接一個，<strong>由上而下</strong>依序執行</div></div><div style='background:#fefce8;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🔀</div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.9rem;'>選擇：遇到岔路</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>依條件判斷「是／否」，<strong>走不同的路</strong></div></div><div style='background:#f5f3ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🔁</div><strong style='color:#5b21b6;font-size:.9rem;'>重複：繞回去</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>條件還沒達成，就<strong>回到前面</strong>再做一次</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#fefce8;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'> 🔑 任何演算法，都可以用這三種走法組合出來。第 10 週會正式學「結構化程式設計」。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 5, "title": "第一節 隨堂測驗", "chapter": "第一節：為什麼要畫流程圖", "bg": "purple", "quiz": "q1", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:54px;margin-bottom:16px;'>📝</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>第一節 隨堂測驗</h1>\n  <p style='color:#e9d5ff;font-size:1rem;'>流程圖的用途 ｜ 3 題</p>\n  <p style='color:#c4b5fd;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:18px;'>按「下一頁 →」開始作答</p>\n</div>\n", "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 6, "title": "流程圖符號一覽", "chapter": "第二節：流程圖符號", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🔣 流程圖的符號與意義</h2>\n<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:150px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>開始／結束</div></div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#334155;'><strong>開始／結束</strong>：流程的起點與終點（橢圓形）</div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:150px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>處理</div></div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#334155;'><strong>處理</strong>：執行一項工作、計算（矩形）</div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(10% 0,100% 0,90% 100%,0 100%);background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;width:150px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸入／輸出</div></div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#334155;'><strong>輸入／輸出</strong>：讀取資料或顯示結果（平行四邊形）</div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 50%,50% 100%,0 50%);background:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;width:210px;padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>決策</div></div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#334155;'><strong>決策</strong>：判斷條件，分成「是／否」兩條路（菱形）</div></div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(8% 0,92% 0,100% 50%,92% 100%,8% 100%,0 50%);background:#ede9fe;color:#4c1d95;width:150px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>迴圈</div></div><div style='font-size:.85rem;color:#334155;'><strong>迴圈</strong>：描述重複的次數或範圍（六邊形）</div></div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 ➡️ 另外還有<strong>箭頭</strong>（流程方向）和<strong>小圓圈</strong>（連接點，流程圖太長要接到另一頁時使用）。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 7, "title": "畫流程圖的規則", "chapter": "第二節：流程圖符號", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>📐 畫流程圖的 5 個規則</h2>\n<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>1</div><div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.88rem;'>一個開始、一個結束</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>每張流程圖都從「開始」出發，最後到「結束」</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>2</div><div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.88rem;'>由上而下、由左而右</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>主要的流程方向保持一致，比較好讀</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>3</div><div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.88rem;'>每個符號只做一件事</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>一個矩形裡不要塞三個動作</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>4</div><div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.88rem;'>決策一定有兩個出口</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>菱形要標出「是」和「否」兩條路</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>5</div><div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.88rem;'>箭頭不要交叉</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>線太亂時，用連接點或重新排版</div></div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 8, "title": "找錯誤", "chapter": "第二節：流程圖符號", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🔍 找錯誤：這張流程圖哪裡怪怪的？</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>開始</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸入分數</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>← ①</div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 50%,50% 100%,0 50%);background:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;width:230px;padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>分數 ≥ 60</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>← ② 只有「是」</div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(10% 0,100% 0,90% 100%,0 100%);background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>顯示「及格」</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>結束</div></div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#fff7ed;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🕵️</div><strong style='color:#9a3412;font-size:.9rem;'>你找到了嗎？</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'><details><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#9a3412;\">看答案</summary>① 「輸入分數」應該用<strong>平行四邊形</strong>（輸入／輸出），不是矩形。<br><br>② 決策菱形只畫了「是」，<strong>少了「否」</strong>的出口：不及格時要做什麼？應該加一條「否 → 顯示不及格」。</details></div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 9, "title": "畫流程圖的工具", "chapter": "第二節：流程圖符號", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🛠️ 用什麼工具畫流程圖？</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='background:#fefce8;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>✏️</div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.9rem;'>紙和筆</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>最快！先手繪草稿，想清楚再上電腦</div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🖌️</div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;'>Google 繪圖</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>在雲端硬碟新增「Google 繪圖」，用「形狀」和「線條」拉出流程圖，可以插入到 Google 文件</div></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>📐</div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.9rem;'>draw.io（diagrams.net）</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>免費線上繪圖網站，內建標準流程圖符號，可以存到 Google 雲端硬碟</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 💡 小技巧：先畫好一個符號，按 Ctrl＋C、Ctrl＋V 複製，再改文字，整張圖的大小才會一致。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 10, "title": "第二節 隨堂測驗", "chapter": "第二節：流程圖符號", "bg": "purple", "quiz": "q2", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:54px;margin-bottom:16px;'>📝</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>第二節 隨堂測驗</h1>\n  <p style='color:#e9d5ff;font-size:1rem;'>流程圖符號與規則 ｜ 3 題</p>\n  <p style='color:#c4b5fd;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:18px;'>按「下一頁 →」開始作答</p>\n</div>\n", "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 11, "title": "蛋炒飯的演算法", "chapter": "第三節：蛋炒飯流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🍚 蛋炒飯的演算法（文字版）</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:50%;'>輸入</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:50%;'>輸出</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>油、蛋、飯、調味料</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>一盤蛋炒飯</td></tr></table>\n<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fefce8;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>1</div><div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.88rem;'>鍋中倒入適量的油</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fefce8;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>2</div><div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.88rem;'>油熱了嗎？沒熱就繼續加熱</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fefce8;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>3</div><div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.88rem;'>開中火，加入蛋</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fefce8;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>4</div><div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.88rem;'>蛋凝固了嗎？沒凝固就快速攪拌</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fefce8;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>5</div><div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.88rem;'>加入米飯；飯散開了嗎？沒散開就翻炒</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fefce8;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>6</div><div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.88rem;'>加入調味料拌勻，結束</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🔍</div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;'>找一找</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>這份演算法裡：<br>🔹 有幾個「判斷」？<br>🔹 判斷「否」的時候要做什麼？<br>🔹 做完之後要回到哪裡？<br><br>👉 下一頁把它畫成流程圖！</div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 12, "title": "蛋炒飯流程圖", "chapter": "第三節：蛋炒飯流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🔀 蛋炒飯流程圖</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>開始</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>放入適量的油</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 50%,50% 100%,0 50%);background:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;width:230px;padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>油熱了嗎？</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>否 → 加熱，再回來判斷</div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>開中火，加入蛋</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 50%,50% 100%,0 50%);background:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;width:230px;padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>蛋凝固了嗎？</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>否 → 快速攪拌，再回來判斷</div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>加入米飯</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 50%,50% 100%,0 50%);background:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;width:230px;padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>飯散開了嗎？</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>否 → 翻炒，再回來判斷</div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>加入調料拌勻</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>結束</div></div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#f5f3ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>📖</div><strong style='color:#5b21b6;font-size:.9rem;'>讀圖重點</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>🔹 三個菱形＝三個判斷<br>🔹 判斷「是」→ 往下走<br>🔹 判斷「否」→ 做完動作後<strong>繞回菱形</strong>再判斷一次<br><br>「繞回去再判斷」就是<strong>重複</strong>，直到條件成立才離開。</div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 13, "title": "追蹤流程圖", "chapter": "第三節：蛋炒飯流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>👣 追蹤流程圖：照著走一遍</h2>\n<table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:12px;'><tr style='background:#1E3A5F;color:#fff;'><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:20%;'>第幾次檢查</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:22%;'>油熱了嗎？</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:18%;'>走哪條路</th><th style='padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;width:40%;'>下一步</th></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>1</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>否</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>否</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>加熱 → 回到判斷</td></tr><tr style='background:#f8fafc;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>2</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>否</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>否</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>加熱 → 回到判斷</td></tr><tr style='background:#fff;'><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>3</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>是</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>是</td><td style='padding:8px 12px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;color:#334155;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;'>開中火，加入蛋</td></tr></table>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #2563eb;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'>💬 🧠 「追蹤」是檢查流程圖對不對的好方法：假設一些情況，用手指沿著箭頭走，看會不會卡住或停不下來。這個例子的「加熱」做了 2 次，但流程圖只畫了 1 個「加熱」——這就是重複的威力！</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 14, "title": "輸入與輸出：求平均數", "chapter": "第三節：蛋炒飯流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🧮 數學問題也能畫：求 A 與 B 的平均數</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>開始</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(10% 0,100% 0,90% 100%,0 100%);background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸入 A</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(10% 0,100% 0,90% 100%,0 100%);background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸入 B</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;color:#1e3a8a;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>平均 ＝ (A＋B) ÷ 2</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(10% 0,100% 0,90% 100%,0 100%);background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸出 平均</div></div></div><div style='width:230px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:230px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:170px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>結束</div></div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#f0fdf4;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>📊</div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.9rem;'>問題分析</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>🔹 <strong>輸入</strong>：兩個數字 A、B<br>🔹 <strong>處理</strong>：(A＋B) ÷ 2<br>🔹 <strong>輸出</strong>：平均數<br><br>這張流程圖<strong>沒有菱形</strong>，從上到下一路走完，是最單純的<strong>循序</strong>流程。<br><br>📌 第 12 週會用 Scratch 把它寫成程式！</div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 15, "title": "第三節 隨堂測驗", "chapter": "第三節：蛋炒飯流程圖", "bg": "purple", "quiz": "q3", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:54px;margin-bottom:16px;'>📝</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>第三節 隨堂測驗</h1>\n  <p style='color:#e9d5ff;font-size:1rem;'>畫與追蹤流程圖 ｜ 3 題</p>\n  <p style='color:#c4b5fd;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:18px;'>按「下一頁 →」開始作答</p>\n</div>\n", "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 16, "title": "讀流程圖：奇數還是偶數", "chapter": "第四節：讀懂流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🔢 讀流程圖：判斷奇數或偶數</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:240px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:180px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>開始</div></div></div><div style='width:240px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:240px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(10% 0,100% 0,90% 100%,0 100%);background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;width:180px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸入 數字</div></div></div><div style='width:240px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:240px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 50%,50% 100%,0 50%);background:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;width:240px;padding:22px 26px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>數字 ÷ 2 的餘數 ＝ 0？</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>是 → 輸出「偶數」</div></div><div style='width:240px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:240px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='clip-path:polygon(10% 0,100% 0,90% 100%,0 100%);background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;width:180px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>輸出「奇數」</div></div><div style='font-size:.75rem;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px;'>（否的路）</div></div><div style='width:240px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.3;'>↓</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;'><div style='width:240px;display:flex;justify-content:center;'><div style='border-radius:999px;background:#1e3a5f;color:#fff;width:180px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;'>結束</div></div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>👣</div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;'>追蹤看看</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>輸入 <strong>7</strong>：7 ÷ 2 ＝ 3 餘 <strong>1</strong> → 否 → 輸出？<br><br>輸入 <strong>10</strong>：10 ÷ 2 ＝ 5 餘 <strong>0</strong> → 是 → 輸出？<br><br><details><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af;\">看答案</summary>7 → 奇數；10 → 偶數</details></div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 17, "title": "先判斷還是先做？", "chapter": "第四節：讀懂流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>🎲 闖關遊戲：先判斷，還是先做？</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='background:#eff6ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>✊</div><strong style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;'>前判斷：先猜拳再前進</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>回合開始 → 和關主猜拳 → <strong>贏了</strong>才前進一格 → 再猜……<br><br>如果第一次就輸：<strong>完全不前進</strong>。</div></div><div style='background:#f5f3ff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>🏃</div><strong style='color:#5b21b6;font-size:.9rem;'>後判斷：先前進再猜拳</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>回合開始 → <strong>先前進一格</strong> → 和關主猜拳 → 贏了再前進……<br><br>如果第一次就輸：<strong>至少前進了一格</strong>。</div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#fefce8;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;'><p style='color:#374151;font-size:.88rem;margin:0;line-height:1.7;'> 🧠 判斷放在「重複動作」的<strong>前面或後面</strong>，結果會不同：前判斷可能一次都不做，後判斷至少做一次。</p></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 18, "title": "畫畫看：過馬路", "chapter": "第四節：讀懂流程圖", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>✏️ 課堂練習：畫出「安全過馬路」的流程圖</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:12px;'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>1</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>走到斑馬線前停下</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>2</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>看行人號誌：是綠燈嗎？</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>否 → 等待，再看一次</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>3</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>左右看：有車輛轉彎嗎？</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'>是 → 等車子過去，再看一次</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;'><div style='width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;'>4</div><div><strong style='color:#166534;font-size:.88rem;'>快步走過斑馬線</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.6;'></div></div></div></div>\n<div style='background:#fefce8;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><div style='font-size:1.8rem;'>📝</div><strong style='color:#854d0e;font-size:.9rem;'>要求</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>🔹 用正確的符號<br>🔹 至少 <strong>2 個決策菱形</strong><br>🔹 每個菱形都標出「是／否」<br>🔹 先在紙上畫草稿，再用 Google 繪圖完成</div></div></div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 19, "title": "第四節 隨堂測驗", "chapter": "第四節：讀懂流程圖", "bg": "purple", "quiz": "q4", "html": "\n<div style='text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;'>\n  <div style='font-size:54px;margin-bottom:16px;'>📝</div>\n  <h1 style='font-size:2rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;'>第四節 隨堂測驗</h1>\n  <p style='color:#e9d5ff;font-size:1rem;'>讀懂流程圖 ｜ 3 題</p>\n  <p style='color:#c4b5fd;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:18px;'>按「下一頁 →」開始作答</p>\n</div>\n", "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 20, "title": "個人實作：流程圖設計學習單", "chapter": "個人實作", "bg": "white", "html": "<h2 class='slide-title'>📝 個人實作：流程圖設計學習單</h2>\n<div style='background:#eff6ff;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:12px;'><p style='color:#1e40af;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;'>📋 在 Google 文件的學習單中完成</p><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;'><div style='background:#f8fafc;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><strong style='color:#334155;font-size:.9rem;'>任務 1：基本題</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>把「求三角形面積（底 × 高 ÷ 2）」畫成流程圖，標出輸入、處理、輸出</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><strong style='color:#334155;font-size:.9rem;'>任務 2：生活題</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>自選一件生活任務（例如出門前檢查、使用自助洗衣機），流程圖至少含 1 個決策</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;'><strong style='color:#334155;font-size:.9rem;'>任務 3：追蹤</strong><div style='font-size:.8rem;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.7;'>幫任務 2 設計 2 種情況，寫出每種情況會走哪些步驟</div></div></div>\n</div><div style='background:#fffbeb;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;'><strong style='color:#92400e;font-size:.9rem;'>📏 評分（課程計畫：流程圖繪製）</strong><p style='font-size:.78rem;color:#334155;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.8;'><strong style='color:#059669;'>A</strong> 能恰當使用符號，繪製完整且正確的流程圖<br><strong style='color:#2563eb;'>B</strong> 能自行完成完整的流程圖<br><strong style='color:#d97706;'>C</strong> 能仿照範例繪製流程圖<br><strong style='color:#dc2626;'>D</strong> 僅能仿照繪製部分流程圖</p></div>", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}, {"id": 21, "title": "本章重點回顧", "chapter": "個人實作", "bg": "navy", "html": "\n<h2 style='color:#fff;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;'>📌 第 8–9 週 重點回顧</h2>\n<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;'><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>流程圖</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>用標準符號和箭頭畫出演算法，比文字更清楚</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>五種符號</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>橢圓＝開始結束、矩形＝處理、平行四邊形＝輸入輸出、菱形＝決策、六邊形＝迴圈</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>規則</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>一個開始一個結束、由上而下、決策要有是／否兩個出口</p></div><div style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;'><strong style='color:#93c5fd;font-size:.9rem;'>追蹤</strong><p style='color:#e2e8f0;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.7;'>假設情況、沿著箭頭走一遍，檢查流程圖是否正確</p></div></div>\n<div style='background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(13,148,136,.35),rgba(107,63,160,.35));border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;'>\n  <p style='color:#fff;font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:700;margin:0;'>流程圖畫好了，電腦要怎麼「看得懂」它？</p>\n  <p style='color:#cbd5e1;font-size:.82rem;margin-top:6px;'>下一週：程式語言與結構化程式設計</p>\n</div>\n", "quiz": null, "chart": null, "video": null}]